{"id":"aff0f953833f2445","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-graded-proof-system.md","title":"Graded Proof System","display":"df-graded-proof-system — Graded Proof System","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-graded-proof-system","aliases":["72-df-graded-proof-system"],"display":"df-graded-proof-system — Graded Proof System","depends_on":["[[72-df-propositional-proof-system]]"],"source_location":"Pudlak, Chapter VIII, sections 2.2-2.3; printed pp. 550-551; PDF pp. 562-563; local parameterized grading, not a source definition","source_statement_status":"local-interface-repair-source-context-only","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked","round2_verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-graded-proof-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-graded-proof-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-graded-proof-system — Graded Proof System"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d9d13f2ac55f5a6d\" href=\"?note=d9d13f2ac55f5a6d\" title=\"72-df-propositional-proof-system\">72-df-propositional-proof-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Pudlak, Chapter VIII, sections 2.2-2.3; printed pp. 550-551; PDF pp. 562-563; local parameterized grading, not a source definition"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"local-interface-repair-source-context-only"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked"},{"key":"round2_verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathrm{TAUT}\">\\(F:\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathrm{TAUT}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9d13f2ac55f5a6d\" href=\"?note=d9d13f2ac55f5a6d\" title=\"72-df-propositional-proof-system\">72-df-propositional-proof-system</a> 的 Cook–Reckhow 证明系统，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{TAUT}\">\\(\\tau\\in\\mathrm{TAUT}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:\\Sigma^*\\to\\omega\">\\(d:\\Sigma^*\\to\\omega\\)</span> 是另外指定的证明分级函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\omega\">\\(k\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\infty\">\\(\\infty\\)</span> 大于每个自然数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\pi|\">\\(|\\pi|\\)</span> 为证明串长。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{F,d,\\leq k}(\\tau)=\\{\\pi\\in\\Sigma^*:F(\\pi)=\\tau\\land d(\\pi)\\leq k\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Proof}_{F,d,\\leq k}(\\tau)=\\{\\pi\\in\\Sigma^*:F(\\pi)=\\tau\\land d(\\pi)\\leq k\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s^k_{F,d}(\\tau)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\min\\{|\\pi|:\\pi\\in\\operatorname{Proof}_{F,d,\\leq k}(\\tau)\\},&amp;\\operatorname{Proof}_{F,d,\\leq k}(\\tau)\\neq\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\infty,&amp;\\operatorname{Proof}_{F,d,\\leq k}(\\tau)=\\varnothing.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s^k_{F,d}(\\tau)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\min\\{|\\pi|:\\pi\\in\\operatorname{Proof}_{F,d,\\leq k}(\\tau)\\},&amp;\\operatorname{Proof}_{F,d,\\leq k}(\\tau)\\neq\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\infty,&amp;\\operatorname{Proof}_{F,d,\\leq k}(\\tau)=\\varnothing.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Chapter VIII，§2.2–2.3，印刷页 550–551，PDF 页 562–563，讨论大小、行数和证明中公式复杂度等不同度量；本节点是已有 graded-proof-system 记号的参数化整理，并非原书另一个定义。</li>\n<li>原先从未经结构化的证明串直接读取 dependency DAG 深度，且将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 当作既是 Frege 规则结构又是证明输出函数。现在明确给出 Cook–Reckhow 总函数与单独的分级参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span>；若要使用 DAG 深度，须先固定携带依赖边的证明编码并将该深度函数作为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>The value is defined even when no depth-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> proof exists. The family grades proof size by a separately specified measure. 这里不把证明 DAG 深度与 bounded-depth Frege 中的公式联结词深度混同。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-propositional-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"d9d13f2ac55f5a6d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-propositional-proof-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"d9d13f2ac55f5a6d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F:\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathrm{TAUT}$ 是 [[72-df-propositional-proof-system]] 的 Cook–Reckhow 证明系统，$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$，$\\tau\\in\\mathrm{TAUT}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"F:\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathrm{TAUT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{TAUT}","display":false},{"tex":"d:\\Sigma^*\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"|\\pi|","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Proof}_{F,d,\\leq k}(\\tau)=\\{\\pi\\in\\Sigma^*:F(\\pi)=\\tau\\land d(\\pi)\\leq k\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"s^k_{F,d}(\\tau)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\min\\{|\\pi|:\\pi\\in\\operatorname{Proof}_{F,d,\\leq k}(\\tau)\\},&\\operatorname{Proof}_{F,d,\\leq k}(\\tau)\\neq\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\infty,&\\operatorname{Proof}_{F,d,\\leq k}(\\tau)=\\varnothing.\n\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false}],"bytes":2219,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-347","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-graded-proof-system|df-graded-proof-system — Graded Proof System]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-345","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[df-graded-proof-system — Graded Proof System](72-df-graded-proof-system.md)"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-373","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-graded-proof-system|df-graded-proof-system — Graded Proof System]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-125","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-graded-proof-system]]"}],"outgoing":["d9d13f2ac55f5a6d"]}